# Speech acts
#
# Saying something is an event. What was said is a separate record that doesn't become true by bei
# ng said.

@prefix iy:   <https://example.org/manichchilambu#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix crm:  <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/> .
@prefix crminf: <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/extensions/crminf/> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix time: <http://www.w3.org/2006/time#> .

<https://example.org/manichchilambu/m10_speech> a owl:Ontology ; rdfs:label "Speech acts" ; owl:imports <https://example.org/manichchilambu> .
# Closest standard term: crm:E7_Activity

iy:Assertion a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf iy:Speech .
iy:Accusation a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf iy:Assertion .
iy:Testimony a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf iy:Assertion .
iy:Order a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf iy:Speech .
iy:Teaching a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf iy:Speech .
iy:Prayer a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf iy:Speech .
iy:Lament a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf iy:Speech .

iy:addressee a owl:ObjectProperty .
iy:carries a owl:ObjectProperty .
